GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w fix-up for php-8.4.26: the three stanzas of GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w.patch that
GNU patch cannot apply at this tag, rebased onto it. Apply AFTER GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w.patch.
PRE-DISCLOSURE VENDOR MATERIAL: same embargo as the main patch.

Why ........... tag php-8.4.26 (c31ae58ecbedc7a85dac0eee5a6a88da73543e70) was cut before the series'
                merge-base ee0f3c5315dfa659bd0a6f0812259feaa7329561; upstream commits between the two
                changed the context of these files. Pre-flight 2026-10-19: GNU patch
                rejected hunk 1 of ext/date/lib/parse_date.c and hunk 6 of
                ext/spl/spl_fixedarray.c and needed fuzz 2 for four more hunks in those
                two files and in ext/opcache/ZendAccelerator.c; git apply rejected all
                three files. (Wording avoids patch's own status phrases on purpose,
                because patch --verbose echoes this header into build logs.)
How ........... on a checkout of the tag, with the merge-base's blobs available,
                git apply --3way of the derived patch; the two conflicts were resolved
                by hand and the three files exported with git diff --text, so every
                hunk here is exact at the tag (applies without fuzz or displacement).
Resolutions ... ext/date/lib/parse_date.c: the series re-dated the re2c banner on
                line 1; the tag's banner is kept (the generated code hunks are the
                vendor's, unchanged).
                ext/spl/spl_fixedarray.c: the series makes spl_fixedarray_copy_ctor()
                fallible in spl_fixedarray_object_new_ex(); upstream had meanwhile (after
                this tag) added an else-branch setting the resize sentinel there. That
                upstream change is not part of this advisory and is not imported: the
                block keeps the tag's shape (8.4: the series also relocates the block
                below the parent walk; the relocation is kept, the else-branch is not).
                ext/opcache/ZendAccelerator.c: merged automatically (upstream had
                moved the ZEND_ATOMIC_FENCE_RELEASE/inheritance_cache store).
Verified ...... for each file, (tag + this fix-up) and (merge-base + vendor stanza =
                the series' post-image blob) differ by exactly the upstream drift
                tag..merge-base, nothing else (tools/fixup-check, see REPORT.md).
Source ........ software/php/stereo-integration/tools/fixups/GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w-fixup-8.4.diff
                (sha256 f51e69620421b8656621b80083a1b5b5e06525167a28594d63d0365808f1fca8), written by
                tools/derive-php-patches.sh together with GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w.patch.
Blobs ......... the "index OLD..NEW" lines below name the tag's blob as OLD.

